ps but you don't  even have to get into all that stuff  because all you have to do is point out  that he came in under bush and that Joe  Arpaio let him out argument over  yeah and unfortunately some of those  earlier arguments about the crime rate  of undocumented and documented  immigrants we made those claims in our  long-form piece about undocumented  immigration look at some of the comments  if you are ready and please don't let  children see the comments on that video  if you are ready to see the depths of  just the bottom of the barrel of  political discussion look at the  comments on our exposition of the  reality that among other realities  undocumented and documented immigrants  commit crimes at a lower rate than  american-born citizens
 

